@revert_cuts
title: Revert reductions and cuts to public sector salaries
view-if: public_cuts > 0
subtitle: \[-1 budget\]
choose-if: government_budget > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough budget.
on-arrival: {!
    G.deactivateLaw(Q, "public_cuts", undefined, true);
    Q.public_cuts -= 1;
    Q.government_budget -= 1
!}

Extraordinary pay-outs have been restored, and salaries for public sector workers will now raise with inflation. Slowly, contracting to supply vacancies due to retirements are re-starting. This is far from an expansion of capabilities nor an improvement of conditions, but it is a step in the right direction nonetheless.

